hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1088","(119) Maidan-e-jang se kisi jamaat ki taraf bhagne wale ke bayan ka bab: 1126 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Isa al-Tabba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ek sariyya mein bheja, to log hat kar peeche hat gaye, phir hum Madina mein dakhil hue aur gharon mein chhup gaye, phir hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne zahir hue to humne kaha: Hum halak ho gaye Ya Rasulullah, hum bhag jane wale hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Balke tum dobara hamla karne wale ho, main tumhari jamaat hun."
